    Build a typed OpenAI-Responses-backed text-generation tool.

    Expected invocation arguments:
        {
          "prompt": str,
          "model_id": str | None,       # optional; resolver remains authority
          "max_tokens": int | None,     # bounded
          "instructions": str | None,   # optional bounded system instruction
        }

    The returned text is available at:
        result.metadata["value"]["text"]

    It is also retained as an Artifact for provenance and later inspection.
    """

